                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector_git.bb",
                    "line": 34,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "```suggestion\nPACKAGECONFIG[xz] = \"-Ddump-compression-algorithm=xz,,,,,gzip zstd\"\nPACKAGECONFIG[gzip] = \"-Ddump-compression-algorithm=gzip,,,,,xz zstd\"\nPACKAGECONFIG[zstd] = \"-Ddump-compression-algorithm=zstd,,,zstd,,xz gzip\"\n```\n\nhttps://docs.yoctoproject.org/singleindex.html#term-PACKAGECONFIG\n\nThe format is:\n\n1. config option with (-Ddump-compression-algorithm=...)\n2. config option without (none)\n3. DEPENDS\n4. RDEPENDS\n5. RRECOMMENDS\n6. conflicting options\n\nI think all of them we missed one comma, and the last one is missing where the ZSTD should go in RECOMMENDS."
                },
