                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This belongs on line 34?  Unless we explicitly need it in the dreport package.  To be honest, I have no understanding why dreport is in a separate package.  We should probably just remove it as a separate package."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector_git.bb",
                    "line": 76,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "It seems that only dreport and scripts are installed in this CLI tool: https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/master/meta-yadro/recipes-yadro/cli/obmc-yadro-cli_git.bb#L20 .  I am afraid that removing xz could break something if they rely on it instead of the busybox version?  I'd prefer to remove the package split and the xz package in a separate patch if that's ok."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/dump/phosphor-debug-collector_git.bb",
                    "line": 76,
